{"id":"atlas-intro","type":"text","x":0,"y":0,"width":3600,"height":200,"text":"**Sports and workouts / NOS · 1.43-B**\n\n21 system members · 13 one-hop ghost neighbours · 39 canonical edges\nEvery incoming and outgoing edge of a member is shown, including parallel edges. Ghost cards retain status text and gap badges; grey borders mark neighbours unless a high/critical gap requires red. Arrows retain source direction; MISSING means an absent connection, not working data flow.\nCyan data · orange control · green persist · purple schedule · yellow UI · red event.\n[[NOS System Map.canvas|Return to overview]]","color":"5"},
{"id":"hw-qmi8658-imu","type":"text","x":2556,"y":396,"width":400,"height":272,"text":"**QMI8658 IMU (0x6B)**\n6-axis accelerometer/gyro, INT on GPIO8 (not…\n\nruns: Hardware. Read about 150 times/s by board-sense, with the screen on or off.\n\n`WORKING` · ⚠ [[Gaps|4 gaps]]\n[[Hardware and drivers|Open note]]\n↗ GHOST · one-hop neighbour","color":"#808890"},
{"id":"drv-battery","type":"text","x":1872,"y":1136,"width":400,"height":296,"text":"**Battery sampler and percent model**\n8 ADC reads per second, median, EMA 1/5,…\n\nruns: Triggered at 1 Hz from board-sense, screen on or off.\n\n`PARTIAL`\n[[Power and battery|Open note]]\n↗ GHOST · one-hop neighbour","color":"#808890"},
{"id":"drv-ext-hr","type":"text","x":2328,"y":1136,"width":400,"height":296,"text":"**MAX30102 HR driver (ext_hr)**\nStreams red/IR FIFO into…\n\nruns: ext task: FIFO every 120 ms with a lease, first background read +2 min after boot.\n\n`PARTIAL`\n[[Health and activity|Open note]]\n↗ GHOST · one-hop neighbour","color":"#808890"},
{"id":"drv-ext-gps","type":"text","x":2784,"y":1136,"width":400,"height":296,"text":"**GNSS driver (ext_gps)**\nNMEA parser with baud probing; supplies fix,…\n\nruns: ext task while a getter or owner keeps it alive.\n\n`PARTIAL`\n[[Hardware and drivers|Open note]]\n↗ GHOST · one-hop neighbour","color":"#808890"},
{"id":"drv-imu-hal","type":"text","x":3240,"y":1136,"width":400,"height":296,"text":"**IMU recorder HAL (imu_hal.c)**\nCreates the imu-rate timer and the imu-…\n\nruns: Only while a manual recording runs.\n\n`WORKING`\n[[Sports and workouts|Open note]]\n● SYSTEM MEMBER","color":"4"},
{"id":"task-imu-sample","type":"text","x":1416,"y":1900,"width":400,"height":272,"text":"**imu-sample task**\nReads IMU samples on each imu-rate timer…\n\nruns: prio 3. 25/50/100 Hz, only while recording.\n\n`WORKING`\n[[Sports and workouts|Open note]]\n● SYSTEM MEMBER","color":"4"},
{"id":"task-board-sense","type":"text","x":1872,"y":1900,"width":400,"height":272,"text":"**board-sense task**\nIMU loop (3 reads per cycle, about 150/s)…\n\nruns: prio 2, 4 KB static, no affinity. 20 ms cycle, always on, screen off included.\n\n`WORKING` · ⚠ [[Gaps|6 gaps]]\n[[Hardware and drivers|Open note]]\n↗ GHOST · one-hop neighbour","color":"1"},
{"id":"task-sports-sd","type":"text","x":2328,"y":1900,"width":400,"height":272,"text":"**sports_sd task**\nSingle SD writer for the sports journal:…\n\nruns: prio 1, 4 KB PSRAM, no affinity. 1 s drain, 512-record batch.\n\n`WORKING`\n[[Sports and workouts|Open note]]\n● SYSTEM MEMBER","color":"4"},
{"id":"task-workout-sd","type":"text","x":2784,"y":1900,"width":400,"height":272,"text":"**workout_sd task**\nWrites the workout session image as…\n\nruns: prio 2, 6144 B. 500 ms loop; checkpoint every 30 s while running.\n\n`WORKING`\n[[Sports and workouts|Open note]]\n● SYSTEM MEMBER","color":"4"},
{"id":"task-imu-write","type":"text","x":3240,"y":1900,"width":400,"height":272,"text":"**imu-write task**\nDrains the recorder queue to…\n\nruns: prio 1, 6 KB. 20 ms loop, only while recording.\n\n`WORKING`\n[[Sports and workouts|Open note]]\n● SYSTEM MEMBER","color":"4"},
{"id":"timer-imu-rate","type":"text","x":3696,"y":1900,"width":400,"height":272,"text":"**imu-rate esp_timer**\nPeriodic timer that clocks imu-sample at the…\n\nruns: esp_timer, 1e6/hz us, only while recording.\n\n`WORKING`\n[[Sports and workouts|Open note]]\n● SYSTEM MEMBER","color":"4"},
{"id":"svc-hub","type":"text","x":48,"y":2640,"width":400,"height":296,"text":"**Services hub (svc_init / svc_tick)**\nservices_tick = svc_tick + background_tick,…\n\nruns: UI task. Every frame when ON; once a second in OFF, AOD and SENSOR.\n\n`WORKING`\n[[Services hub|Open note]]\n↗ GHOST · one-hop neighbour","color":"#808890"},
{"id":"svc-sports-logger","type":"text","x":504,"y":2640,"width":400,"height":296,"text":"**Sports journal (sensor/event logger)**\nQueues 64 B checksummed records (SP_IMU,…\n\nruns: sports_tick 1 Hz; 60 s records; IMU records from board-sense.\n\n`WORKING`\n[[Sports and workouts|Open note]]\n● SYSTEM MEMBER","color":"4"},
{"id":"svc-activity","type":"text","x":960,"y":2640,"width":400,"height":296,"text":"**Activity service (svc_activity)**\nTurns pedometer output into daily steps, km,…\n\nruns: act_tick 1 Hz on the UI task, also screen off. Checkpoint every 10 min when dirty.\n\n`PARTIAL` · ⚠ [[Gaps|14 gaps]]\n[[Health and activity|Open note]]\n↗ GHOST · one-hop neighbour","color":"#808890"},
{"id":"svc-workout-motion","type":"text","x":1416,"y":2640,"width":400,"height":296,"text":"**Wrist movement episode detector**\nFinds valid-motion bursts from the ~150 Hz…\n\nruns: board-sense per sample.\n\n`WORKING`\n[[Sports and workouts|Open note]]\n● SYSTEM MEMBER","color":"4"},
{"id":"svc-background-jobs","type":"text","x":1872,"y":2640,"width":400,"height":296,"text":"**Background jobs monitor**\nTracks 13 job states (motion, steps, calorie…\n\nruns: background_tick, internally 1 Hz.\n\n`WORKING`\n[[Power and battery|Open note]]\n↗ GHOST · one-hop neighbour","color":"#808890"},
{"id":"svc-workout","type":"text","x":2328,"y":2640,"width":400,"height":296,"text":"**Workout session engine**\nRuns sessions (start/pause/lap/finish),…\n\nruns: workout_tick in svc_tick; 1 Hz screen off; checkpoint 30 s.\n\n`PARTIAL` · ⚠ [[Gaps|13 gaps]]\n[[Sports and workouts|Open note]]\n● SYSTEM MEMBER","color":"1"},
