{"id":"svc-tuning","type":"text","x":3696,"y":2640,"width":400,"height":296,"text":"**Gesture tuning**\nWalk and knock thresholds (sportstune, 20 B)…\n\nruns: Read on every IMU sample.\n\n`WORKING`\n[[Settings and developer|Open note]]\n↗ GHOST · one-hop neighbour","color":"#808890"},
